  Samsung Galaxy Tab 3 7.0 (SM-T210) | Alpine Linux ARMv7 | Kernel 3.4.5
======================================================================
  Essential Commands:
   * server-status          : System summary (CPU temp, RAM, Disk, Battery, Uptime)
   * server-mode <linux|android|hybrid|status> : 3 operation modes (Server, Tablet, Hybrid)
   * cctv <start|stop|status> : 24/7 circular video surveillance camera
   * screensaver <art|aquarium|fireplace|matrix|stop> : Frutiger Aero & ambient desk ornament
   * retro-store            : Nostalgic KitKat games & retro apps catalog
   * screen <on|off|brightness 0-255> : Control LCD backlight and display
   * play-sound <file>      : Crystal clear audio playback via Android AudioTrack
   * alarm <play|stop|list> : Smart alarm clock / wake-up chime player
   * radio <lofi|jazz|rock|url> : Live internet radio streaming
   * yt "<search|url>"      : YouTube audio player (Kernel 3.4.5 IPv4 forced)
   * console                : Attach to live tmux session mirroring tablet screen
   * wake-pc / pc-status    : Wake up host PC via Wake-on-LAN
